  "releaseNotes": "# Release Notes\n\n## 2.9.0\n\n### Added\n\n- add `FileSearch` and `FileSearchStores` (dc36c9f)\n- add convenience property `Stores` (b23dc65)\n- add tests for `FileSearch` and `FileSearchStores` (ef6bc61)\n- add log message for failed HTTP request (aa6ba28)\n- add client/resource for `Documents` (a76d159)\n- add `CustomLongRunningOperation` (35393ce)\n- add common interface for different `Operations` (8ca923a)\n- add client/module for `Operations` (cdc98f2)\n- add sample for `FileSearch` (7de8efc)\n- add MIME type guard for `FileSearchStore` (fa48689)\n- add v1alpha discovery for Vertex AI (d463b55)\n\n### Changed\n\n- refactor cloning of `HttpRequestMessage` (04a55c7)\n- change `CustomMetadata` to a list (c40e335)\n- change access modifier (75c7794)\n- increased outputTokenLimit for Nano Banana (ab429b2)\n- revision 20251106 (fde1e30)\n- Merge pull request #121 from mscraftsman/dependabot/nuget/dot-config/docfx-2.78.4 (bcca495)\n- upgrade docfx from 2.78.3 to 2.78.4 (9b40a40)\n- chore: housekeeping (94b90c7)\n- chore: use CancellationToken (8350179)\n- chore: add ILogger (b349daf)\n- chore: add XMLdocs (7728740)\n\n## Changelog\n\nChanges across all versions have been documented in the [Changelog](CHANGELOG.md).",
